{"version":1,"content":"<p>45歲日本演技派男星高橋一生，日前主演舞台劇《THE BEE》時意外受傷，導致手部骨折見血，已入院接受手術。</p><p>其事務所表示，他會辭演餘下7場。</p><p>本月26日起的演出，會改由男星北村有起哉頂替。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;據當日親眼</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:16:14.357669+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T15:03:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:09:35.978651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:09:35.978651+00:00","content_hash":"b3c923f7a4b2d7a615e04a15c55a8e67a2fe581258c6cb7a631733b9f9e09f9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}